     so one stack covers every language in the opening/closing rotation. */
  --font-indic:
    "Noto Sans Kannada", "Noto Sans Tamil", "Noto Sans Telugu", "Noto Sans Malayalam",
    "Noto Sans Devanagari", "Noto Sans Bengali", "Noto Sans Gujarati",
